{"synopsis":"Sang protagonis, Hanbit diculik oleh seorang Dewi. Demi menemukan petunjuk untuk menyelamatkan dunia bernama 'Erfort', dia harus menjalani 55 kali siklus regresi, possession, dan reinkarnasi di dunia lain. Namun, mengalami 55 kali siklus tersebut berarti dia juga harus menanggung penderitaan berupa kematian sebanyak 55 kali. Hanbit yang tidak sanggup lagi menahan penderitaan itu akhirnya mengatakan kepada Sang Dewi bahwa dia menyerah, lalu dia pun berhasil kembali ke dunia asalnya. Akan tetapi, game yang dia mainkan sekadar untuk mengisi waktu luang ternyata adalah dunia tempat dia mengalami 55 kali siklus tersebut. Semakin dalam dia menelusuri game itu, dia menyadari bahwa ada konspirasi gelap dari Sang Dewi yang tengah menantinya... Akankah Hanbit mampu mengungkap niat terselubung Sang Dewi yang sebenarnya?","alternative_title":"귀환자의 히든 공략 스트리밍","author":"Giwol, Haji","artist":"Naji","chapters":[{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"434d40a8-68dd-4138-9948-81d4319716e9","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"8f7d9512-fccf-4399-a2ec-0faa10b6d096","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"c0820b17-53d7-444d-8489-f918de531705","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-07-18"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"d37312a8-ceed-4866-83c1-397a4735ded0","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"5764f6b5-9ea7-4a25-8754-648abbfcbc12","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-07-04"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"ffd2c1da-bbcc-427d-ab3a-3439fc52358a","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-06-29"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"546ac46d-6aea-4bc5-a4d7-1052997e7bb1","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-06-24"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"0f9781b6-dc49-440d-8eab-cccf9a2e1ac9","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-06-24"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"60f323b3-3efa-4ff1-aae0-5d3b82823cc8","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-06-08"},{"number":"31"